# DIRECTIVE ZERO — AM-06 sshd_config
# SSH on 22. Key-only auth — players get access after the crypto challenge
# decrypts the analyst SSH key.

Port 22
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes

ChallengeResponseAuthentication no
UsePAM yes

X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd yes

AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server